<div class="guide-code"><h3>Agent \u672C\u673A\u793A\u4F8B\u547D\u4EE4</h3><pre>git clone --branch main --single-branch https://github.com/memoio/agent_did_skill.git
cd agent_did_skill/skills/memo-agent-did-opbnb-testnet
npm ci --omit=dev
# \u5148\u6309 Invitation \u7684 agentSetup \u914D\u7F6E\u516C\u5F00\u73AF\u5883\u53D8\u91CF
node bin/memo-agent-opbnb-testnet identity ensure
node bin/memo-agent-opbnb-testnet pair invitation accept invitation.json profile.json document.json
node bin/memo-agent-opbnb-testnet binding pending
node bin/memo-agent-opbnb-testnet binding inspect &lt;\u8BF7\u6C42ID&gt;
node bin/memo-agent-opbnb-testnet binding approve &lt;\u8BF7\u6C42ID&gt;</pre></div>
